    "objective": "Fulfil the boat's private two-type delivery demand by consensual cargo exchange and use of two congested shared docks.",
    "natural_termination": "All three boats complete their private demands, otherwise horizon ninety. A completed boat leaves the collision world and has only NOOP until joint completion. Natural completion takes priority at the horizon.",
